      <main class="detail-page-container" id="main-content">
         <div class="universal-page-container">
            <div class="universal-page-container__top layout-container layout-container--with-sidebar page-container--has-sidebar">
               <div class="layout-container__block">
                  <div class="layout-container__block__wrapper">
                     <div class="hero-banner hero-banner--short animatedParent">
                        <div class="hero-banner__image" style="background-image: url('/_images/athletics/20251021-soccergame190-1600x500.jpg')"><img src="/_images/athletics/20251021-soccergame190-768x500.jpg" alt="Celebrating Raptor Pride Since 1946"></div>
                        <div class="hero-banner__screen"></div>
                        <div class="hero-banner__content">
                           <h1 class="hero-banner__headline animated fadeInLeftShort">
                              Celebrating Raptor Pride Since 1946</h1>
                           <div class="hero-banner__description animated fadeInUpShort delay-250">Get Involved with Athletics in Raptor Country.<img src="/_images/athletics/raptors-logo-center-white-400.png" alt="MC Raptors" style="width: 270px; display: block;"></div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="section-padding-horizontal">
                        <div class="cards-section columns columns-background columns-2 section-padding-all cards-condensed-mid">
                           <div class="cards">
                              <div class=" card">
                                 <div class="card__wrapper">
                                    
                                    <div class="h5">Winter Pep Rally and Monty Mascot Reveal</div>
                                    
                                    <p>Thursday, December 10, 4 p.m.<br>Large Gym, Rockville Campus</p>
                                    
                                    <p><strong>New Look. Same Big Energy. Meet the NEW Monty!</strong></p>
                                    
                                    <p>Get ready to show your Raptor pride as we unveil the new Monty and cheer on our men's
                                       and women's basketball teams.</p>
                                    
                                    <p><strong>Purple. Pep Rally. Pride. </strong>Wear your MC purple and bring your Raptor spirit.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>Enjoy an afternoon filled with music, games, food, fun activities, and giveaways as
                                       we celebrate the basketball season and introduce Monty's exciting new look.</p>
                                    
                                    <p><strong>Wear purple. Bring the energy. Let's go, Raptors!</strong></p>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class=" card">
                                 <div class="card__wrapper">
                                    
                                    <div class="h5">Winter Spirit Night</div>
                                    
                                    <p>Wednesday, January 27, 4:30 p.m.<br>Large Gym, Rockville Campus</p>
                                    
                                    <p>Join us for an exciting evening of MC Basketball, Raptor pride, and opportunities
                                       to reconnect with fellow alumni, students, and employees.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>The fun kicks off at 4:30 p.m. with a pre-game pep rally and alumni networking, followed
                                       by the women’s basketball game at 5:30 p.m. Enjoy more fun, interactive activities,
                                       and giveaways throughout the evening before the men’s team takes the court at 7:30
                                       p.m.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>Between games we'll honor former MC head men's basketball coach Steve Hobson who was
                                       recently inducted into the inaugural Newberry College Hall of Master Coaches, Class
                                       of 2026.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>Whether you’re reconnecting with old friends, cheering on the Raptors, or simply enjoying
                                       the excitement, there’s something for everyone.</p>
                                    
                                    <p><strong>Come celebrate your MC pride. We can’t wait to see you there!</strong></p>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="callout-content clearfix clear">
                           <div class="image-captioned right medium-width"><img src="/_images/athletics/20260724_montyoncampus14-467x310.jpg" alt="Monty the Raptor mascot leaning on MC letters on campus"></div>
                           <div class="h6">
                              
                              <h2 xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables"><a id="monty"></a>Be Monty!</h2>
                              </div>
                           <div>
                              
                              <div class="h6">Become the face of MC Spirit</div>
                              
                              <p>Step inside the suit to represent the Raptors at athletic events, campus celebrations,
                                 and special appearances. Help bring Monty to life!</p>
                              
                              <div class="accordion-list" id="cust-00-accordion-list">
                                 <div class="panel-group" id="accordion-d13e260">
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                       <div class="panel-heading">
                                          <div class="panel-title"><a data-toggle="collapse" class="js-tabcollapse-panel-heading collapsed" data-parent="#accordion-d13e260" aria-expanded="false" href="#collapse-d13e260-1" id="panel-d13e260-1"><span>Apply to be Monty</span><div class="plus-minus__icon"></div></a></div>
                                       </div>
                                       <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="collapse-d13e260-1">
                                          <div class="panel-body js-tabcollapse-panel-body clearfix">
                                             
                                             <p>Montgomery College is looking for energetic, enthusiastic performers <strong>to step into the role of Monty the Raptor</strong>! As one of the most visible ambassadors for MC, Monty brings energy, school spirit,
                                                and Raptor pride to athletic events, College celebrations, community events, social
                                                media, and more.</p>
                                             
                                             <p>If you love MC, enjoy entertaining others, and aren't afraid to show some personality,
                                                this paid opportunity could be for you.</p>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What You'll Do</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>Bring Monty to life at College events, athletic events, community appearances, photo
                                                   opportunities, and other activities.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Engage students, employees, families, alumni, and community members through energetic,
                                                   friendly, nonverbal interaction.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Participate in social media content, videos, promotional campaigns, and photo shoots.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Stay in character throughout every appearance and help create memorable experiences
                                                   for audiences of all ages.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Represent Montgomery College and the Raptor brand with enthusiasm and professionalism.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Follow all mascot safety, costume-care, and performance guidelines.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Arrive on time, prepared, and ready to bring the Raptor spirit!</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What We're Looking For</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>At least 18 years of age.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Able to meet the costume fit requirements established for Monty.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Able to safely perform the physical requirements of the role, with or without reasonable
                                                   accommodation.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Comfortable standing, walking, dancing, bending, waving, and moving continuously while
                                                   in costume.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Able to wear a full-body mascot costume for up to 30 minutes at a time with scheduled
                                                   breaks.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Energetic, outgoing, dependable, and comfortable performing in front of crowds.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Strong nonverbal communication skills and expressive body language.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Available for scheduled appearances that may include weekdays, evenings, weekends,
                                                   and occasional holidays.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Reliable transportation to scheduled event locations.</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What to Expect at Your Monty Audition</h3>
                                             
                                             <p>Selected candidates will be invited to an in-costume audition where we'll look for
                                                creativity, movement, spatial awareness, nonverbal communication, and - most importantly
                                                - personality.</p>
                                             
                                             <p>Monty doesn't speak, so your movement becomes his voice. Think big gestures, expressive
                                                reactions, and lots of Raptor energy!</p>
                                             
                                             <p>No mascot experience required. Training will be provided.</p>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">Schedule &amp; Pay</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>Part-time, flexible hours based on the mascot appearance calendar.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Typical assignments may include weekdays, evenings, weekends, and holidays.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Pay: $50.00 per hour.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Work location: In person at Montgomery College and approved community locations.</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <p>Ready to bring Monty to life?</p>
                                             
                                             <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9003794/Monty-The-Raptor-Mascot-Performer-Application" class="btn blue" target="_blank">apply here</a>
                                             
                                             
                                             
                                             </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                       <div class="panel-heading">
                                          <div class="panel-title"><a data-toggle="collapse" class="js-tabcollapse-panel-heading collapsed" data-parent="#accordion-d13e260" aria-expanded="false" href="#collapse-d13e260-2" id="panel-d13e260-2"><span>Become a Monty the Raptor Mascot Handler</span><div class="plus-minus__icon"></div></a></div>
                                       </div>
                                       <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="collapse-d13e260-2">
                                          <div class="panel-body js-tabcollapse-panel-body clearfix">
                                             
                                             <p>Montgomery College is looking for confident, dependable individuals to serve as <strong>Mascot Handlers</strong> and help bring Monty the Raptor to life. The Mascot Handler is Monty's behind-the-scenes
                                                partner - helping the performer navigate appearances safely, stay on schedule, interact
                                                with audiences, and create memorable moments filled with Raptor pride.</p>
                                             
                                             <p>Because Monty doesn't speak, the Handler also helps serve as Monty's voice when needed,
                                                communicating with event organizers, students, employees, families, alumni, and community
                                                members while protecting the character and the experience.</p>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What You'll Do</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>Accompany Monty to College events, athletic events, community appearances, photo opportunities,
                                                   and other approved activities.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Help the Mascot Performer safely navigate crowds, stairs, doorways, uneven surfaces,
                                                   restricted sightlines, and other surroundings.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Serve as Monty's voice when needed by communicating with event organizers and audience
                                                   members while allowing Monty to remain in character.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Help manage the appearance schedule, timing, breaks, entrances, exits, props, cues,
                                                   and other logistics.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Support fun, positive interactions with students, employees, families, alumni, and
                                                   community members.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Help monitor crowd activity and create appropriate space around Monty during appearances.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Assist the performer with costume preparation, costume changes, hydration, breaks,
                                                   and proper costume care.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Participate in social media content, videos, promotional campaigns, and photo shoots
                                                   as needed.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Represent Montgomery College and the Raptor brand with enthusiasm, good judgment,
                                                   and professionalism.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Follow all mascot safety, emergency response, costume-care, and performance guidelines.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Arrive on time, prepared, and ready to bring the Raptor spirit!</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What We're Looking For</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>At least 18 years of age.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Energetic, friendly, dependable, observant, and comfortable interacting with a wide
                                                   range of audiences.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Good judgment and the ability to stay calm, attentive, and safety-focused in busy
                                                   environments.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Able to anticipate the Mascot Performer's needs and interpret nonverbal cues.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Comfortable helping manage schedules, event logistics, crowd flow, and communication
                                                   with event staff.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Able to safely perform the physical requirements of the Mascot Handler role, with
                                                   or without reasonable accommodation.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Available for scheduled appearances that may include weekdays, evenings, weekends,
                                                   and occasional holidays.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Reliable transportation to scheduled event locations.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Multilingual communication skills are a plus, but are not required.</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">What to Expect at Your Monty Handler Audition</h3>
                                             
                                             <p>Selected candidates will be invited to a practical audition where we'll look at communication,
                                                situational awareness, crowd interaction, teamwork, problem-solving, and your ability
                                                to anticipate and respond to the Mascot Performer's nonverbal cues.<br>Monty doesn't speak, so a great Handler knows when to step in, when to step back,
                                                and how to help Monty's personality shine while keeping the performer and audience
                                                safe.</p>
                                             
                                             <p>No mascot handling experience required. Training will be provided.</p>
                                             
                                             <h3 class="h6">Schedule &amp; Pay</h3>
                                             
                                             <ul>
                                                
                                                <li>Part-time, flexible hours based on the mascot appearance calendar.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Typical assignments may include weekdays, evenings, weekends, and holidays.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Pay: $25.00 per hour.</li>
                                                
                                                <li>Work location: In person at Montgomery College campuses and approved community locations.</li>
                                                </ul>
                                             
                                             <p>Ready to Join Team Monty?</p>
                                             
                                             <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/9004823/Monty-The-Raptor-Mascot-Handler-Application" class="btn blue" target="_blank">apply here</a>
                                             
                                             
                                             
                                             </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                              </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <h2>
                           <div class="clear"></div>A tradition of sports excellence awaits you.</h2>
                        
                        
                        <div class="image-captioned right medium-width animatedParent">
                           <div class=" animated fadeIn"><img src="/_images/athletics/mc-zoom-new-raptor-full-4.png" alt="The MC raptor with a purple overlay and the MC Raptors athletics logo with a soaring raptor landing on the logo"></div>
                        </div> 
                        
                        
                        <p>MC is a member of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) and competes
                           in the MDJUCO Athletic Conference. Participate in men’s and women’s intercollegiate
                           competition or co-ed intramural sports and show off your Raptor pride.</p>
                        
                        <p><a href="#hype">Watch some MCTV Hype videos</a> featuring the the Women's Soccer and Volleyball Teams, along with the Men's Soccer
                           Team.</p>
                        
                        <a href="https://www.mcraptors.com/landing/index" class="btn purple" target="_blank">Visit MC's Athletics Hub</a>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        
                        <div class="cards-section columns columns-background columns-3 section-padding-all cards-condensed-mid">
                           <div class="cards">
                              <div class=" card">
                                 <div class="card__wrapper">
                                    
                                    <div class="image-captioned center medium-width animatedParent">
                                       <div class=" animated fadeIn"><a href="/_images/athletics/athletics-crowd-2-960x660.jpg" target=""><img src="/_images/athletics/athletics-crowd-2-960x660.jpg" alt="Fans cheering in the stands of the MC indoor basketball arena"></a></div>
                                    </div> 
                                    
                                    
                                    <h3 class="h5">Join or Support Today</h3>
                                    
                                    <p>MC offers nine intercollegiate sports—four for men (baseball, basketball, soccer,
                                       and track and field), and five for women (basketball, soccer, softball, track and
                                       field, and volleyball), as well as cheerleading and co-recreational sports. <a href="http://www.mcraptors.com/landing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More about our sports<span class="reader newwindow"><span class="sr-only">&nbsp;new window</span></span></a>.</p>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class=" card">
                                 <div class="card__wrapper">
                                    
                                    <div class="image-captioned center medium-width animatedParent">
                                       <div class=" animated fadeIn"><img src="/_images/life-at-mc/athletics/mens-baseball-960x660.jpg" alt="Baseball player sliding into second base which is covered by a Raptor player"></div>
                                    </div> 
                                    
                                    
                                    <h3 class="h5">Take Your Athletics to the Next Level</h3>
                                    
                                    <p>With more than 150 student-athletes competing in nine sports, there is something all
                                       year to participate in. And our athletes don't stop here—many transferred to four-year
                                       institutions to continue their academic and athletic endeavors. <a href="http://www.mcraptors.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get involved<span class="reader newwindow"><span class="sr-only">&nbsp;new window</span></span></a>.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>&nbsp;</p>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class=" card">
                                 <div class="card__wrapper">
                                    
                                    <div class="image-captioned center medium-width animatedParent">
                                       <div class=" animated fadeIn"><img src="/_images/athletics/athletics-tom-bichy-960x660headshot.jpg" alt="Black and white photo of a past Athletics Hall of Fame inductee"></div>
                                    </div> 
                                    
                                    
                                    <h3 class="h5">Athletics Hall of Fame</h3>
                                    
                                    <p>Outstanding athletic achievement as a student or coach while at or after leaving MC
                                       are criteria for being nominated into the MC Athletic Hall of Fame. Read a list of
                                       our past inductees on the <a href="/alumni-friends-donors/alumni-hall-of-fame.html">Hall of Fame page</a>.</p>
                                    </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <h2>Why MC?</h2>
                        
                        <p>All three campuses offer sports. We are dedicated to preparing you for a four-year
                           school or degree, with more than 140+ programs of study, 300 scholarship opportunities
                           and numerous athlete-specific resources. <a href="/about-mc/index.html">Learn more about MC</a>.</p>
                        
                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        
                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        
                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                     </div>
                  </div>
